        "rationale": "All pins, platform.lock, Gemfile tag, Gemfile.lock revision, and the newly required cms-delete-published-preview.yml caller were updated to v0.1.104, but the canonical verifier was reported as FAIL with exit 1 on the workflow-set check (old-preview-cleanup.yml EXTRA), so the cap at 4 applies and parity with the release's caller set was not established."
